{"version":1,"content":"<p>男團MIRROR今天（1日）全員齊集出席新專輯《12》簽名會，於近千「鏡粉」（粉絲暱稱）前逐一分享將成軍8周年感受，他們分組玩遊戲，輸家柳應廷（Jer）被罰抱起姜濤，他表現吃力笑爆全場，姜濤被「公主抱」顯得興奮。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.987918+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T10:54:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.561350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"a6b60c9fd01b9f06264e445dcca4a0a3531a057b6864c18c23284d5d245ff1c7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}